Buying an electric car might not be the best decision for your sister given her constraints. She can't install a home charger because she lives in an apartment.&#x20;

Public charging, while available, might be inconvenient. It might take longer than filling up a gas car. Then, there's battery range anxiety. Her occasional 250-mile trips to your parents would be stressful because she might run out of charge on the way.

It's probably not the smarter choice for her right now.
